{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434582-jen-experiment-art-thread-year-of-the-metal-ox-edition","id":1434582,"title":"Jen Experiment Art Thread: Year of the Metal Ox edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-02-05T04:36:56-08:00","id":1434582,"title":"Jen Experiment Art Thread: Year of the Metal Ox edition","content":"<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/498704231407288320/806943888442261505/B8FAA411-DF36-4F30-8911-368ECF3F4CAF.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> <div align=\"center\"><b>- Ten Li of Peach Blossom Theodotus, Fading Gold Lotus Sulumor, The Lady of Darkness in Bloodstained Robe -</b> <hr /> <div align=\"left\">It\u2019s almost 2021! In the Lunar Calendar that is. And there are so many T\u1ebft activities that I want to draw but I don\u2019t have enough characters! </div> </div> <br /> So if you want some festive sketches for your PC (or just NPC) and don\u2019t mind seeing them in different clothing then I just need some description of their appearance to work with, things like the color of their skin, eyes, and hair, their personality (unless you don\u2019t mind your ANGRY! Dawn being all happy and such), their hairstyle would also be cool too, though there is gonna be lots of turban, hat, and hair bun so there is a chance the original hairstyle won\u2019t appear \ud83d\udc7b Their artifacts would also be a choice, but it\u2019s an experiment thread so it definitely gonna get tinkered with, like you Grand Goremaul is now a watermelon killstick for example, so bewaaare the transformation ~","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T05:58:46-08:00","id":1434588,"title":"","content":"Knight Raiton is fair-skinned, with black neck-length hair and dark brown eyes. He has toned muscles suggesting athleticism, but not to a \u201csuperhero\u201d extent. His artifact is a moonsilver silken armor that shapeshifts to match personas he dons.<br /> <br /> The armor\u2019s appearance can vary drastically, but always includes:<br /> A belt<br /> A hat, hood, crown, or other headpiece<br /> Silver or gray coloration<br /> Black or other dark coloration (charcoal, Gotham green, navy, et cetera.)<br /> Some sort of imagery suggestive of feathers (feather patterns worked into jewelry, fraying at the edge of a coat).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T08:03:18-08:00","id":1434601,"title":"","content":"Joyous Lark is a Night Caste sorceress. Not scholarly by nature, she came by her affinity for fire magic the same way she comes by most of her valuables - she stole it. Deep within the manse of an Ifrit Lord, she found <i>something</i> that opened her eyes to the numinous power of flame - and her daring infiltration won her Solar exaltation. <br /> <br /> Joyous Lark is not very tall and has a slim, athletic build, with pale olive skin, long black hair, and blue eyes. Her expression is usually impish, gleeful, or sly. She was raised as a performer, and even before her exaltation she was a practitioner of the art of fire twirling. She therefore favours clothing that she can move freely in, and when she is not prowling rooftops or stealing whatever isn't nailed down, she prefers festive colours, particularly red, with accents of black and yellow/gold. She usually wears one or more sashes in which she conceals lockpicks, throwing knives, and other essentials for a girl's night out. Her hair is usually in a high ponytail or pigtails, all the better to whip around dramatically when she is twirling fire-sticks all over the place or jumping from rooftop to rooftop. While her &quot;day job&quot; as a dancer <i>is</i> a cover for her rampant criminality, she does find a genuine joy and fulfillment in her performances.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Measure of Hope is right about everything.&quot; - Wise Old Guru<br /> <br /> Currently running an Exalted 2.5 Abyssals game in a homebrew modern shard because I value neither my time or my sanity, and I'm loving almost every minute of it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23907-measure-of-hope","name":"Measure of Hope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T08:46:12-08:00","id":1434609,"title":"","content":"You're welcome to use either of my characters (as are you all -- please draw my characters, just let me see the art and ask before you 'ship them with anyone). You can draw them together or seperately or whatever. Transformation is cool.<br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> <b>Mnemon Danireya</b> - (Female, bisexual, Air Aspected Dragon-Blooded Sorcerer)<br /> <br /> Very pale, snow-white skin<br /> Deep blue eyes<br /> Very fair, light blonde hair<br /> Usually worn in a bun or twin plaits<br /> 5'4&quot;<br /> Hourglass figure (large bust, thin waist, large hips)<br /> <br /> She has a bronze axe (not an artifact) and a white jade shield (Perdurant Vault) and an Orichcalcum Collar of Dawn's Cleansing Light.<br /> <br /> Reya is a social butterfly who'll happily celebrate any occassion. She works hard (very serious at work) and plays hard (usually laughing and happy). Would happy celebrate something that doesn't exist with a hovering First Age Solar.<br /> <br /> Reya will happily wear any style, so long as she thinks it looks good on her. (You're the artist, if you think it looks good, she thinks it looks good.) I've been drawing her pregnant recently if her normal body-type doesn't interest you.<br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> <b>Cynis Ganan</b> - (Male, pansexual, Earth Aspected Dragon-Blooded Sorcerer, Reya's husband)<br /> <br /> Mixed race/brown skin or Invulnerable Skin of Bronze<br /> Bright blue eyes<br /> Very dark brown/black hair<br /> Usually closely cropped short<br /> 6'0&quot;<br /> Very muscular<br /> <br /> If you want to use his artifacts he normally has:<br /> <br /> A white jade tetsubo<br /> A magical pearl necklace that keeps him clean<br /> An Ultimately Useful Tube (which he pretty much exclusively uses as a wooden flute)<br /> <br /> Ganan is a rare breed: a socially inept Dynast. He's permenantly confused by social situations. Probably scowling -- doesn't understand why he's celebrating &quot;New Year 2021&quot; especially with a bunch of Anathema. &quot;Why am I here? What am I doing? Who are all these hot dads?&quot;<br /> <br /> Ganan doesn't dress himself: he wears whatever he's told (including accessories, jewlery, make-up, etc). This can mean he's wearing something that is uncomfortable or embarrasses him, but he's usually too much of an oblivious bimbo to care. Reya recently made him <a href=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/776836949377155072/792074443886297148/imageedit_9_8667686892.png\" target=\"_blank\">wear a Santa outfit</a> - which confused and bemused him.<br /> <br /> ****<br /> <br /> So long as you're not going to draw anything sexual/humiliating/weird with them, you can also draw:<br /> <br /> <b>Cynis Jinabar </b>(She/her)<br /> <br /> Mixed race/brown skin<br /> Green flecked hazel eyes<br /> Very dark brown curly hair<br /> 5'0&quot;<br /> Slim build<br /> <br /> She has a green jade power pole.<br /> <br /> Loud, malicious, Fire Aspected trickster<br /> <br /> *<br /> <br /> <b>Gracious Pealing Melody </b>(She/her)<br /> <br /> Caucasian<br /> Brown eyes<br /> Straight brown hair<br /> 5'8&quot;<br /> Pear shaped (fat with small breasts)<br /> <br /> She has an orichalcum short power bow.<br /> <br /> Confident, a bawdy singer, Wood aspect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 02-05-2021, 01:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T10:40:48-08:00","id":1434623,"title":"","content":"Wu Ma<br /> Fire Aspect Dragonblooded bandit turned exorcist<br /> Barrel chested and stocky<br /> Long reddish-black hair tied up in a top-knot <br /> Long reddish black beard<br /> Mix of Imperial and Varangi (almond eyes and somewhere between tanned and rust colored skin)<br /> Worn leather satchel of exorcism gear<br /> Ever-present drinking gourd<br /> Wields Zelator from Arms of the Chosen<br /> <br /> (Since I suck at descriptions, for much more relevant descriptions I picture him as a mix of Yin Chek Hsia from A Chinese Ghost Story, Fire Master from Deadful Melody, with a splash of the typical depiction of Guan Yu. And yes, the actor behind both characters is where I got the name)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":882,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","user":"SamuraiMujuru","date":". 02-05-2021, 01:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T12:46:54-08:00","id":1434635,"title":"","content":"Why is Theodotus wearing a shirt? This is heresy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T17:24:35-08:00","id":1434650,"title":"","content":"The Saint of Promised Silence, or &quot;Sil&quot; is a Midnight Caste Abyssal. Generally very affable, if eccentric. Occasionally unsettling and eldritch. Definitely okay with different clothes. As for <span style=\"font-size:13px\">T\u1ebft activities, I suggest praying at a family altar(that's actually dedicated to the Neverborn or something), or making a bunch of sticky rice food.</span><br /> <img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/481568210043273237/783161235084148747/Sil_Concept_2.png?width=1269&amp;height=1066\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-05T17:30:27-08:00","id":1434651,"title":"","content":"Oh snap, well if you are looking for a monk, and thus wanna draw some robes and stuff, I have<br /> <br /> The Little Mountain<br /> Earth Aspect Dragon Blooded child. (Around 14-15)<br /> Immaculate monk robes and style,<br /> Tanned skin that has a slight granite texture.<br /> She is quite short, less than five feet (About 147cm)<br /> She has a very strong build though.<br /> Her weapon is Faith's Pillar from What Fire Has Wrought (There is a pic on 322).<br /> Like all immaculate monks she has a bald head.<br /> Her eyes are sapphire blue.<br /> <br /> <br /> And if you are looking for a beast person,<br /> <br /> I have<br /> Kidd<br /> Full Moon Lunar Exalted<br /> She is always in her hybrid alligator form. Green scaled skin,<br /> Sharp teeth, Yellow reptile eyes.<br /> Her face is human in shape, not alligator shaped.<br /> She has red brown hair cropped usually to the base of her neck.<br /> She is also muscular and also young, mid teen.<br /> About 150cm.<br /> Her only weapons are her claws and a meat cleaver.<br /> I will give artist full choice on how to showcase her tattoos.<br /> <br /> Obviously if you have too much to work on feel free to skip, but if you do draw either it would rule. I ADORE your artwork.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1777-kell_tamer","name":"Kell_Tamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1777_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-06T06:52:53-08:00","id":1434684,"title":"","content":"Oh! A Jen open art OC thread! I hope I\u2019m not too late!<br /> <br /> <b>*******</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:20px\"><u><b>K the Jester</b></u></span><br /> <br /> Eclipse Caste entertainer (&amp; secret liberator/Underground Railroad leader of freed Guild slaves). Runs her own circus; <b>K's Flying Circus</b> (which really flies).<br /> <br /> Skin- <b>pale, with freckles</b><br /> Eyes- <b>piercing, icy blue</b><br /> Hair- <b>ginger red </b><br /> Other- Big smile, gap in front teeth, pointy canines, ears a little pointed (family from the Threshold, with Fae blood in it)<br /> <br /> Stature- <b>Short, athletic, little curvy</b><br /> <br /> Personality- <b>Upbeat, happy, enthusiastic. Extrovert.</b> Has a serious/no none-sense business side the audience raillery sees. (Like Stan Lee + Mentok the Mindtaker [Harvey Birdman, Attorney at Law]).<br /> <br /> <b>*******</b><br /> <br /> She likes ridding tamed Tyrant Lizards, giant Mole Hounds, &amp; Wind Whales. (Only mention this if it amuses you to add.)<br /> <br /> Her artifacts of choice are a Wrack-staff version of Death at the Root (Moon-silver <b>Martial Arts Staff</b> Weapon), &amp; a Hand of the Great Maker (mechanical gauntlet that allows Wyld-Shaping in Creation). (Only mention this if it amuses you to add.)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4428,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","user":"Daredevil","date":". 02-06-2021, 10:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-06T09:03:18-08:00","id":1434690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434582-jen-experiment-art-thread-year-of-the-metal-ox-edition?p=1434609#post1434609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So long as you're not going to draw anything sexual/humiliating/weird with them, you can also draw:</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh no, you don\u2019t have to worry about me ever drawing anything sexual with female characters \ud83d\ude17<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434582-jen-experiment-art-thread-year-of-the-metal-ox-edition?p=1434623#post1434623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wu Ma<br /> Fire Aspect Dragonblooded bandit turned exorcist<br /> Barrel chested and stocky<br /> Long reddish-black hair tied up in a top-knot<br /> Long reddish black beard<br /> Mix of Imperial and Varangi (almond eyes and somewhere between tanned and rust colored skin)<br /> Worn leather satchel of exorcism gear<br /> Ever-present drinking gourd<br /> Wields Zelator from Arms of the Chosen<br /> <br /> (Since I suck at descriptions, for much more relevant descriptions I picture him as a mix of Yin Chek Hsia from A Chinese Ghost Story, Fire Master from Deadful Melody, with a splash of the typical depiction of Guan Yu. And yes, the actor behind both characters is where I got the name)</div> </div> </div> </div>Quite remind me of Zhong Kui in appearance and profession. And by stocky do you mean something <a href=\"https://i2.kknews.cc/SIG=1uonv1o/ctp-vzntr/15229204915816oq96172rn.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">like</a>? Or is it the thick and muscular weightlifter type of body?<br /> <br /> Also what do you think about having half his face covered with only the lower area exposed?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434582-jen-experiment-art-thread-year-of-the-metal-ox-edition?p=1434635#post1434635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why is Theodotus wearing a shirt? This is heresy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have started to cover him more and more in latter designs, more fabric means more area to decorate and hanging fancy trinkets you know. Though I may just end up with a half-chest situation with him wearing an exomis top.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-06T12:24:57-08:00","id":1434696,"title":"","content":"Yaaay what a fun way to celebrate a new year! I look forward to seeing what you do with everyone's characters. I would love to see your take on any of my characters. Here's a few for you to play with. :3 Hope you have fun with them and have a happy new year!<br /> <br /> Kalara, Eclipse Caste. Loves art/artists, fashion, and dressing to impress! She uses dual Prayer Pieces usually.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/20631551205c67f058f27ec039093f16/ebc6144cace1b1d5-42/s1280x1920/38ee90d511dcde15e03838c44e641da0fb067b20.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <hr />Night Locust, Night Caste. Kalara's right-hand man and prankster ninja.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/15e77777c061f748f4998d45a619381d/ebc6144cace1b1d5-b6/s1280x1920/53edd20fb9fe46de1fd4ba1fd206d59f5b2b0903.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> He's pretty bishi under the mask lol!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/b715de95f152717bf4eca2988c57f9b9/ebc6144cace1b1d5-aa/s1280x1920/31f3f45fe60e65b8e75b79ac0708caa867a26858.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <hr />Khazan the Starless Dragon, Fire Aspect. A father figure and mentor of Kalara's. He's also from the South and served as an Ashen Guard captain in Gem, has a fancy beard, and loves good whiskey. He was inspired by Blackbeard the pirate. Art by Jadehand. Feel free to play with his fashion and beard decoration. This guy seems up your alley lol.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://preview.redd.it/b0yvne10bg521.png?width=640&amp;crop=smart&amp;auto=webp&amp;s=bccc726364303bc1ba8adcd0d17b90e3471fa8f6\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/918857-ang-s-exalted-sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Art</a> | <a href=\"http://theuncrucified.angelasasser.com\" target=\"_blank\">My Exalted Fanfiction</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11990-angelicshadow","name":"angelicshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11990_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-06T15:17:02-08:00","id":1434702,"title":"","content":"Suriya Bet Malek of the House of Malek of Ys, bearer of Vainglory (Arms of the Chosen has descriptor) and Spring Razor(Core book), is a dark skinned red haired woman Eclipse caste with a motif of serpents and roses of a...let us say haughty compassionate demeanor. The Noble who on the one hand believes herself better than her peers, but on the other hand believes that her subjects suffering reflects poorly on her talents.<br /> Has a pet Simhata.<br /> Current Comission is here.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1udbaL0F_QLDgEGmW8g-Pf10ft8IPo5It/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1udbaL0F_QLDgEGmW8g-Pf10ft8IPo5It/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1udbaL0F_QLDgEGmW8g-Pf10ft8IPo5It/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/1udbaL0F_QLDgEGmW8g-Pf10ft8IPo5It/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-22T01:39:25-08:00","id":1436523,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><i>Old Year Bronze Lion </i>Cynis Ganan - <i>New Spring Golden Ox</i> Augustus<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/498704231407288320/813335795167264788/image0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> <br /> So every new year, some asshole magic lion comes down from the mountain to wreck stuffs, eats human, and maybe have sex too. The people are this dreading the coming of the first year, and then BAAAAM! Comes the twelve guardians who battles the lion to save the human, but the lion is super strong so it seems that the guardians are losing. Seeing that, the human proceed to bang their gong, throw out firework and bright colors object toward the lion who was distracted for just a moment, but it was enough for the guardian to wound it and causing it to retreat back to the mountain.<br /> <br /> Nobody in the area knows if the story was true or not, but the lion and guardian dance has happened every year now with the lion battling against one of the twelve guardian each year. Muscular men in decorated masks made of wood, beads, and silk performing their dance on new year are said to bring good luck to a community. Their colorful costume, energetic movement, daring maneuvers, and rock-hard abs are sure to entertain many onlookers. Curiously, there is no native lion in the area as far as the people here has remembered.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-22T09:24:49-08:00","id":1436553,"title":"","content":"*Incoherent happy noises*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-22T09:56:26-08:00","id":1436554,"title":"","content":"The clothing details we get from Jen May be my favorite aspect of the art. It\u2019s really useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-02-23T09:08:14-08:00","id":1436690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434582-jen-experiment-art-thread-year-of-the-metal-ox-edition?p=1436553#post1436553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*Incoherent happy noises*</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m happy you like it! I have quite a blast designing his pants and bronze abs \ud83d\udc40<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434582-jen-experiment-art-thread-year-of-the-metal-ox-edition?p=1436554#post1436554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The clothing details we get from Jen May be my favorite aspect of the art. It\u2019s really useful.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s a curse when I need a character who dress plainly since I keep adding stuffs to their cloth! I imagine Theo as looking like a commoner but he always ends up having fancy cloth in the final art \ud83d\udc7b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:07:53-08:00","id":1439640,"title":"","content":"Everything in that image is so beautiful, from the characters themselves to the detailing on the big masks and the textures of the background. I can't wait to see more! I can see how the Spring Festival theme is going to lend itself to amazing Exalted art. Everything is <i>so much</i>. So much colour, so much motion. <br /> <br /> Can you tell it's been a while since I went to a big celebration? This art is like a breath of fresh air. Thanks Jen, keep doing what you do <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Measure of Hope is right about everything.&quot; - Wise Old Guru<br /> <br /> Currently running an Exalted 2.5 Abyssals game in a homebrew modern shard because I value neither my time or my sanity, and I'm loving almost every minute of it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23907-measure-of-hope","name":"Measure of Hope","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":