pired by this ancient <a href=\"https://cdn.tricycle.org/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/hercules_buddha1-943x1024.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Greco-Buddhist mural</a>?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12641-aldosalt","name":"AldoSalt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12641_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-15T21:18:12-07:00","id":1452411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AldoSalt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1434582-jen-experiment-art-thread-year-of-the-metal-ox-edition?p=1452381#post1452381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't have a character to commission, Jen, but I did have a question about the image of <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/post/178005817617/i-ship-gautama-buddha-and-hercules\" target=\"_blank\">Buddha and Heracles </a>that you drew on your Tumblr:<br /> <br /> Specifically, was your sketch inspired by this ancient <a href=\"https://cdn.tricycle.org/wp-content/uploads/2013/05/hercules_buddha1-943x1024.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Greco-Buddhist mural</a>?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yes, horny naked angry man and ex-prince hermit is a crossover I never imagined would happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_